    {
      "uid": "zhcn:486c9e87a9c07cb6c59c0b9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了！诶嘿嘿，我努力啦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a404da85edc460da03cdecc2caf7f24889b30dc2c07224f8a5e5c90558afae",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f505d98e36841226f157dffe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n结束了……那我去跑步咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53fc24197bee267d5b73c90c48144a16386f62ba94f90f88e3917dae68fce52a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34acd4797628a47639161c26",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n帝王大人凯旋归来啦♪欢迎队伍在哪儿啊～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1fd926ccd47ccec2bb452c10d774160ed62ece825b51209618918a2fa33de50",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2debdba7bc37fb4b937de983",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n顺利结束！呼呼，我火速回来了哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b81aab9e42e9fca21f5e9bcdfae0e2bc73014b069bad98e2a6a08716e0e03230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5872c4d9944afbd0f212d866",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "也把我的演出带给了\\n<jobs_placename>的大家！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f3301cad82b10c25b400da5b946825502688de4ea60d3124268a8a7ca323653",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5748291220f1770e3ef3530f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>…\\n好像顺利带动气氛了…太好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6835242f5f488630911b51d67673bc8f63f61bdd439cbab8c8c4e04040ddbfc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5067db7d84f6f1b357909da2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "【快讯】<jobs_placename>\\n拍到未确认飞行黄金船成功举办演出",
      "source_fingerprint": "b134e8e8ef54887b132d7b8388b7a5677a6f33ceb9f46ee6a5f49016a2c82d3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4461613a47612f6dc639f42e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n超级热闹啊，伙伴！嘿嘿…怎么样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c120379e9e1f75426defc5d865061bb771ae59df4d8f4562205119628277eaa6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4122a3497cb9056b2ff8bd3e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了。我要汇报结果，快点过来啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "325fbb07b681304ba177cc86358ebe44331522a7d7c629a9f8defe6ef920a471",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f5d2a8edf4552265e71cdc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\nTadaima回来啦！来吧，让我们拥抱一下回家♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2a858320977584776e7cb2b5f40c9517286ee5ff3111b5a11e17bc7d74bfb52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5195b22c97f170e7c75d703d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了…呼呼，是开阔见闻的美好旅途呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "00ff022df3e3cfea52764f793f5e073c70b3558dd2494929300511f38b0a034b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:519a507e4321e9c3e7ca7c80",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>成功啦！\\n怎么样，菱亚马姐很可靠吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "64735a5c5ea970b69fb80beda8aeb15038ff541d0a79f84fdf49f2acfeee0a63",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbad8b01f5186adef2361746",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在<jobs_placename>，\\n我也不愧于目白家的名号吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e011e920c5b7c917d4276abb46fde5fa8bd3115dd7fe7989155f2c812fb3df12",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f142d6bd64454cb00607b086",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "只要有艾尔在，<jobs_placename>\\n也——成功、最棒、大盛况DE~SU！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbe7699ac5b379a6f8c11422a7b6c6b6492f0c515e8802b2d3b63d2125851824",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c522adbf253cdd2d7b1a1501",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>？\\n当然！由霸王剧团带来圆·满·落·幕…就是这样！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a1d20bae52d5662dc266d17d421c7f6be1695a0a6f9c325c9a794435e0ab9d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e450aceda273facf6e8f1e5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n已经完成了。结果？…来了你就知道。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69731384ee0759dd4af3a798902f5e5cd7f26d55c44fa32f829dfead2eca5efb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bbdc56cd64366a3b0bf5585",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "<jobs_placename>\\n在宾客盈门中顺利结束。详情稍后汇报。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc6dacfc5bc6cc504808fcb18feb86dfc2709f8af35aae855b9ae62638d4af80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e39c9a96ee9fa3169c809d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了。我不在的时候，你们没偷懒吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae2fad625b5347c7f561a42912a47875d87c98216a9db6d29e17dbccbc9596bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15c34af66b4537f8fb37182a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从<jobs_placename>\\n归还啦！来来来请确认战利品～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19a06a7d0015f859d18b08aea952ca0fe247578f316bb6b4bbc2bd0fd493ec3b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "360",
        "1019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d23958ec0ba19859f85de92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呼～…从<jobs_placename>\\n回来了～，请慰劳我一下嘛～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9efef11843b73ebbf730c9b73b55fccce90f250df6693f7c894133d4e865eed",
